- `defines(v3, "is order worth less than 5000", {"Yes", "No"})`: Variable range uses a categorical finite set instead of a numeric interval, failing to faithfully capture the explicit quantitative thresholds ("less than 5000", "greater than or equal to 5000") stated in the source. (SMC6)
- `action(n23, "send the quality report again")`: Payload appends the word "again", which is not documented in the source description ("send the quality report"), altering the node's semantic meaning. (SMC2)